I.. ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION OF ITEMS TO BE DISCUSSED IN CLOSED SESSION

CONFERENCE WITH LABOR NEGOTIATORS
(Government Code Section 54957.6)

Agency Negotiator: 
Peter Brown, Chief Negotiator
Talyn Mirzakhanian, City Manager

Employee Group(s): 
Manhattan Beach Firefighters' Association 
Unrepresented (Executive, Management & Confidential)
Unrepresented Part-Time Employees

II.. RECESS INTO CLOSED SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 4:02 PM, the City Council recessed into Closed Session.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


III.. RECONVENE INTO OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:55 PM, the City Council reconvened into Open Session with the exception of Councilmember Charelian arriving at 6:56 PM.\cf1\i0\par
}


IV.. CLOSED SESSION ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\i\fs22 City Attorney Barrow announced that the City Council went into Closed Session to discuss Labor Negotiations with the groups identified on the agenda. The City Council gave direction to its Negotiators and there was no reportable action taken.\i0\fs24\par
\pard\cf1\fs22\par
}


G.. ADJOURNMENT {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:56 PM, Mayor Howorth adjourned the meeting.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


